pkix-path/src/lib.rs:1053-1057

let child_policies: Vec<_> = tree.iter().filter(...).collect();
// immediately used in tree.retain()

The collect exists to release the shared borrow before tree.retain() takes a mutable borrow. Without a comment explaining this, future readers will try to eliminate the allocation. Add: // collect to release shared borrow before tree.retain takes &mut
